{"url": "https://x.com/andymadrick/status/2095287853450399859", "id": "2095287853450399859", "text": "fun little @bot i made: coffee companion \u2615\n\nhttps://x.ai/bot/SqO-_5207iInz0iDSAFVW\n\ni tell it what beans i have and it recommends a pour over recipe. after brewing, i chat with it to record tasting notes, drawdown time, what worked, what didn\u2019t, etc.\n\nit saves the recipe + all of my notes to a @NotionHQ  database, so there\u2019s a persistent history of every coffee i\u2019ve made.\n\nthen, when i get a new bag or tweak an old recipe, it looks back through previous brews and suggests changes to ratio, flow rate, grind size, temperature, etc.. so every cup builds on the last one.\n\ni\u2019ve never made better coffee in my life. thanks @bot :)", "raw_text": {"text": "fun little @bot i made: coffee companion \u2615\n\nhttps://t.co/Evzr5DATNJ\n\ni tell it what beans i have and it recommends a pour over recipe. after brewing, i chat with it to record tasting notes, drawdown time, what worked, what didn\u2019t, etc.\n\nit saves the recipe + all of my notes to a @NotionHQ  database, so there\u2019s a persistent history of every coffee i\u2019ve made.\n\nthen, when i get a new bag or tweak an old recipe, it looks back through previous brews and suggests changes to ratio, flow rate, grind size, temperature, etc.. so every cup builds on the last one.\n\ni\u2019ve never made better coffee in my life. thanks @bot :)", "display_text_range": [0, 616], "facets": [{"type": "mention", "indices": [11, 15], "original": "bot", "id": "2085838061347217408"}, {"type": "url", "indices": [44, 67], "original": "https://t.co/Evzr5DATNJ", "replacement": "https://x.ai/bot/SqO-_5207iInz0iDSAFVW", "display": "x.ai/bot/SqO-_5207i\u2026"}, {"type": "mention", "indices": [280, 289], "original": "NotionHQ", "id": "708915428454576128"}, {"type": "media", "indices": [280, 303], "id": "2095287553712955393", "display": "pic.x.com/jGUuTbpbmq", "original": "https://t.co/jGUuTbpbmq", "repla